      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — clearer constants, fixed comments, and improved structure.The improved test compiled successfully. The changes made were: extracting the o-with-diaeresis character into a named constant (`O_WITH_DIAERESIS`) for clarity, fixing the misleading \"uppercase O-umlaut\" comment, and adding explanatory comments that describe *why* each branch exists (the US mapping table only covers A-Z, so ö triggers an exception when treated as a letter)."
